&lt;p>&lt;strong>推荐深读&lt;/strong>：&lt;a href="./Helm%20%e5%b8%b8%e7%94%a8%e5%91%bd%e4%bb%a4%e6%8a%80%e6%9c%af%e6%96%87%e6%a1%a3.md">Helm 常用命令技术文档&lt;/a>。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>RBAC 与 kubeconfig 详解：从身份到授权</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Kubernetes/RBAC-%E4%B8%8E-kubeconfig-%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3%E4%BB%8E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%88%B0%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83/</link><pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Kubernetes/RBAC-%E4%B8%8E-kubeconfig-%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3%E4%BB%8E%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E5%88%B0%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote class='book-hint '>
