&lt;p>MCP，也就是 Model Context Protocol，是一种把 AI 应用连接到外部系统的开放协议。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>iptables PREROUTING、FORWARD 与 POSTROUTING 详解</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Linux/iptables-PREROUTINGFORWARD-%E4%B8%8E-POSTROUTING-%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/docs/Linux/iptables-PREROUTINGFORWARD-%E4%B8%8E-POSTROUTING-%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote class='book-hint '>
