&lt;p>Pulumi 是一套 Infrastructure as Code 工具。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>CS自学指南</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/links/202602/CS%E8%87%AA%E5%AD%A6%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/links/202602/CS%E8%87%AA%E5%AD%A6%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description/></item><item><title>why we no longer use LangChain for building our AI agents</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/links/202602/why-nolonger-langchain/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/links/202602/why-nolonger-langchain/</guid><description/></item><item><title>甜甜酱和老陈：停更的 2025 年，我们在干啥？</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/links/202601/%E7%94%9C%E7%94%9C%E9%85%B1%E8%80%81%E9%99%88%E7%9A%84-2025/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/links/202601/%E7%94%9C%E7%94%9C%E9%85%B1%E8%80%81%E9%99%88%E7%9A%84-2025/</guid><description/></item><item><title>We removed 80% of our agent’s tools</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/links/202601/We-removed-80-of-our-agents-tools/</link><pubDate>Sat, 24 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/links/202601/We-removed-80-of-our-agents-tools/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Fine-tuning GPT with OpenAI, Next.js, and Vercel AI SDK</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/links/202601/Fine-tuning-GPT-with-OpenAI-Next/</link><pubDate>Tue, 20 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/links/202601/Fine-tuning-GPT-with-OpenAI-Next/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Pulumi 中的 all 和 apply 方法使用介绍</title><link>https://yindongliang.com/posts/Pulumi-%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84-all-%E5%92%8C-apply-%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D/</link><pubDate>Tue, 13 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/posts/Pulumi-%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84-all-%E5%92%8C-apply-%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p>在 Pulumi 中，&lt;code>all&lt;/code> 和 &lt;code>apply&lt;/code> 是处理 Output 值的关键方法。由于 Pulumi 资源属性通常在运行时才能确定其值（表示为 Output 类型），这两个方法帮助我们处理这些异步值。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="apply-方法">apply 方法&lt;a class="anchor" href="#apply-%e6%96%b9%e6%b3%95">#&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>&lt;code>apply&lt;/code> 用于对单个 Output 值进行转换或执行基于该值的操作：&lt;/p></description></item><item><title/><link>https://yindongliang.com/template/new-post/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yindongliang.com/template/new-post/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>